      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 18 years 8 months ago",
      "body": "Hi Everyone,\nI am a consultant for Truly Madly Baby, the Dragons den investment winning company which sells a huge range of good quality baby and toddler goods from the comfort of home parties.\nWe are looking for more consultants to meet the demand for parties throughout the UK and are holding open days to let people know a bit more about the company.\nOur next one is in Stirling this Sunday (24th feb), the company owner Julie White will be there to do a presentation and answer any questions.\nIf you'd like to book a place or find out more about becoming a consultant or having a party, please get in touch.\nHeather",
